-- [FilteringEnabled] Server Scripts are IMPOSSIBLE to save]]></ProtectedString><bool name="Disabled">true</bool><BinaryString name="AttributesSerialize"></BinaryString><bool name="DefinesCapabilities">false</bool><string name="Name"><![CDATA[Documentation]]></string><SharedString name="Tags">MTAwMDAwMDAwMDAwMDAwMA==</SharedString></Properties><Item class="TextBox" referent="317"><Properties><bool name="ClearTextOnFocus">false</bool><Font name="FontFace"><Family><url><![CDATA[rbxasset://fonts/families/Inconsolata.json]]></url></Family><Weight>400</Weight><Style>Normal</Style></Font><bool name="MultiLine">true</bool><Color3 name="PlaceholderColor3"><R>0.6980392336845398</R><G>0.6980392336845398</G><B>0.6980392336845398</B></Color3><bool name="RichText">true</bool><bool name="ShowNativeInput">false</bool><string name="Text"><![CDATA[--[[

This script is not required for upload/use. It is purely for documentation.


--	{ Character }
	Bosses' actual model.


--	{ Arms }
	Viewmodel arms. These are not required.
	Must contain a Left Arm and Right Arm

--	{ Voice }
	Custom voice for boss. This is optional.
	

--	{ Settings }
	CanRage/CanSuperJump enables the ability to do so.
	Music/Intro can either be a string attribute for a default TC2 song (listed below) or a Sound Instance inside the Settings.
	Class must be a valid TC2 class.
	Health_Multiplier is a multiplier to the bosses' health.
	Jump_Boost/Speed_Boost work like the rage boosts below, but are permanent.
	Voice is a default voice type in the game. Is overwritten if there is a custom Voice folder.


--		{ Rage }
		Each type of rage can be disabled/enabled by setting the attribute to true/false

--			{ Scare }
			Scares enemy players wiihin Scare_Range studs for a maximum of Scare_MaxTime seconds
				
--			{ Uber }
			Gives you SuperCharge for Uber_Time seconds

--			{ Speed }
			Gives you a speed boost of Speed_Boost percentage boost to your speed for Speed_Time seconds.
			(Speed_Boost of 50 means a 1.5x boost)

--			{ Jump }
			Gives you a jump boost, which gives a Jump_Boost percentage boost to your jump height for Jump_Time seconds.
			(Jump_Boost of 200 means a 2x boost)


--		{ Loadout }
		Can give an item in the Primary, Secondary, or Melee slot, with a custom X_DMG amount of damage.
		Items must be valid weapons, and can not have multiple of the same item equipped.






--	{ Default Music }
	You can put any of these strings as an Attribute on the Settings for Music.

	Baldi
	Bloxy Boy
	BrickBattler
	Bridge
	Brutal Marksman
	Generic
	Horror
	Joseph Fitten
	King Abrax
	Mad Mechanic
	Morshu
	Pirate Captain
	Pizza
	Sword Fights on the Heights
	Unfortunate Son
